Before writing the file, validate the JSON mentally (no trailing commas, all arrays closed). Then write to `src/data/unit{N}/chapter{N}/exercises.json`.

After writing, run:
```bash
python3 -c "import json; json.load(open('src/data/unit{N}/chapter{N}/exercises.json')); print('valid')"
```

